        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pared de la antera (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pollen sac wall (exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>葯壁 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
