        <obo:IAO_0000115>One of the two types of short cells in the epidermis of grasses and bamboos. It is usually paired with silica cell.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>c&amp;#233lula de corcho epid&amp;#233rmica (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>c&amp;#233lula suber&amp;#237 epid&amp;#233rmica (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
