        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fiber cell (PO:0025407) that is part of a portion of xylem (PO:0005352) tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PO_GIT:443</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>fibra del xilema (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
