        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#TraitNet"/>
        <rdfs:comment>It may be difficult to distinguish xylem fiber cells, especially fiber tracheids (PO:0000355), from tracheary elements (PO:0000290). Fiber tracheids have bordered pits with smaller pit cavities than the vessel members (PO:0002003) or tracheids (PO:0000301) of the same wood and a distinct pit cavity leading to the cell lumen through the cell wall.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>xylem fiber cell</rdfs:label>
