        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#CL"/>
        <rdfs:comment>May have sinuous anticlinal cell walls that overall give a jigsaw like appearance to the epidermis. Pavement cells are epidermal cells that are not directly associated with a stomatal complex or trichome at maturity, but they share similar developmental origins.</rdfs:comment>
