        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0001007"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An initial stage during which the archesporial cells divide to give rise to primary parietal and sporogenous cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
