        <obo:IAO_0000115>Stage of microgametophyte development during which the pollen reaches mature stage and desiccates.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GRO:0007230</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PO_GIT:509</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
