        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0001016</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Mature pollen stages is reached at three-celled pollen in some angiosperms (maize, rice and Arabidopsis), while in others, the maturepollen has two haploid cells (tobacco, snapdragon).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>L mature pollen stage</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
