        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0001052</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>During this stage leaf shaping (GO:0010358) occurs which is defined as the developmental process that pertains to the organization of a leaf in three-dimensional space once the structure has initially formed.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>vascular leaf expansion stage</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
