        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>子房壁の中間層 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0005025</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#Poaceae"/>
        <rdfs:comment>In some species, such as Arabidopsis, there may be a distinct subepidermal adaxial cell layer. The cells in the mesophyll layer(s) may not differentiate similar to the spongy and palisade cells found in the leaf mesophyll.</rdfs:comment>
