        <owl:annotatedTarget>A peripheral portion of ground tissue (PO:0025059) in a plant axis (PO:0025004) that is composed of cork cambium (phellogen; PO:0005599), phellem (PO:0004003), and phelloderm (PO:0005050).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0471245208</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>POC:curators</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
