            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A portion of plant tissue (PO:0009007) that is the central region of an endosperm (PO:0009089), composed of cells that are significantly larger than those at the periphery, especially the aleurone and sub-aleurone layers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PO_GIT:149</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>endosperma central (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
