        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#Rice"/>
        <rdfs:comment>These first flowers are not necessarily the oldest flowers in the inflorescence. In some cereal plants the flowering starts in the middle of the inflorescence. This stage refers to the whole plant.</rdfs:comment>
