        <obo:IAO_0000115>A seedling development stage (PO:0007131) during which the hypocotyl (PO:0020100) emerges from the seed coat (PO:0009088).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:3826331524</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PO_GIT:460</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
