        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0007621</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Although megaspore and megagametophyte development are normally separate, one spore producing one gametophyte, in some flowering plants a single gametophyte may be produced from two or four spores.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>megagametophyte development stage</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
