        <rdfs:comment>Replace_by whole plant in the gametophyte phase (PO:0028002). The gametophyte arises from the product of meiosis (the spore). Structures that occur only in gametophytes should have a participates_in relation to the gametophyte phase.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>OBSOLETE gametophyte</rdfs:label>
