        <rdfs:comment>&apos;Part&apos; includes both proper parts and the whole plant. CARO:0000003 &apos;connected anatomical structure&apos; is defined as: Material anatomical entity that is a single connected structure with inherent 3D shape, generated by coordinated expression of the organism&apos;s own genome.</rdfs:comment>
