        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#reference"/>
        <rdfs:comment>A spikelet floret (PO:0009082) is enclosed by one or both the flower bracts (PO:0009034);  lemma (PO:0009037) and palea (PO:0009038) and also includes a lodicule (PO:0009036).  To describe a floret of the Asteraceae, use ray flower (PO:0025331) or disk flower (PO:0025332).  Found in Poaceae, Cyperaceae and other Poales.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>spikelet floret</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
