        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#reference"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Usually envelopes most of the seed and is fleshy. If the ovule is pressed against the funicle to form a raphe, it may appear that the aril is growing from the raphe.</rdfs:comment>
