        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0009100</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The burs or bristles in Cenchrus and Pennisetum are not involucres because the fused structures are branches and not bracts.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>involucre</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
