            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A portion of xylem (PO:0005352) tissue that is a distinct ring-like structure composed of tracheids (PO:0000301), that is part of a seed (PO:0009010) and surrounds the hilum (PO:0020063) and forms a groove in the surface of the pericarp (PO:0009084) immediately adjacent to the hilum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PO_GIT:434</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>barra de la traqueida (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
