        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>embri&amp;#243n som&amp;#225tico vegetal (Spanish, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>体細胞plant胚 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025302</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Somatic plant embryos may arise where embryos normally would not arise as a product of apomixis. They may occur on the edges of leaves on some species of Kalanchoe or some ferns.</rdfs:comment>
