        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025439</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The cambial zone generally consists of the initial cells of the cambium and their immediate derivatives, arranged in radial files. This term is used for the cambium (PO:0005597) and surrounding area, especially when the borders of the cambium are not clear.</rdfs:comment>
