        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regular companion cell (exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>standard companion cell (exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>通常の？伴細胞  (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025459</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Found in plants that use apoplastic phloem loading. Unlike sieve tube elements (PO:0000289), ordinary companion cells retain their nuclei and other organelles at maturity.</rdfs:comment>
