        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025514</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>A phyllome lobe may be either rounded or angular at the tip, and may have phyllome teeth (PO:0025515) or phyllome crenae (PO:0025516) on its margin. The corresponding phyllome sinus may be rounded or angular.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>phyllome lamina lobe</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
