        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>葉身辺縁葉脈 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025520</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The leaf lamina intramarginal vein is much thinner than the leaf midvein (PO:0020139; syn: midrib), and is of constant thickness.</rdfs:comment>
