        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#CL"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Occurs in some green alga, such as Ulva.  Participates in the gametophyte development stage (PO:0028003).</rdfs:comment>
