        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025576</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>In a given portion of primary xylem (PO:0005849), metaxylem tracheary elements are generally larger in size, greater in number, are pitted and have more secondary wall material than protoxylem tracheary elements (PO:0025575).</rdfs:comment>
