        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#Pteridophytes"/>
        <rdfs:comment>After fertilization, the venter develops into the spore capsule calyptra (PO:0030037), which protects the sporangium (syn: spore capsule; PO:0025094) containing the developing sporophyte.</rdfs:comment>
