        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/po#CL"/>
        <rdfs:comment>May give rise to a branch of the protonema (including a protonema rhizoid, tmema cell or brachycyte), a gametophore bud, or may not divide further.</rdfs:comment>
