        <rdfs:comment>Lateral root spines cannot grow indeterminately or supply the plant with water and solutes. See JSTOR:43235457 for documentation of lateral root spines in Dioscorea prehensilis (Dioscoreaceae) and Moraea sp. (Iridaceae).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>lateral root spine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
